WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.291 --> 00:00:05.125
Hello.

00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:15.750
Brings the total missing
in West Pine to five,

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.916
all within 36 hours.

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:18.666
Shhh!

00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:19.625
Who are you?

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:21.333
You must never tell a soul.

00:00:22.791 --> 00:00:24.791
Deep in the woods
stands a lone door.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.375
My colony and
all of our practices

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:30.458
exist entirely
to protect the world

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:32.750
from the awful things
beyond that door.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.833
I worry that the wrong person
could learn about this door

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:38.500
and let all those
awful things go free.

00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:40.833
Carrie, what's behind the door?

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.833
Nightmares.
Your worst nightmares.

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:52.916
Are you like the Terminator?

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Have you seen this girl?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.000
I've never seen her.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.375
Tasha, this particular girl
is a cold stone killer.

00:01:01.666 --> 00:01:03.875
You sure she's not around
the corner in your kitchen,

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:05.125
or in your bedroom?

00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:10.833
I'm here to help you.

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.541
Ready to hunt a monster?

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:27.458
This is so metal.

00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:30.166
I'm going to end this thing.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.625
- Why are you walking like that?
- It's my power pose,

00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:39.500
I do it before recitals
when I’m nervous.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.625
Oh, hell’s greatest weakness:
empowered dancers.

00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:42.541
I feel so safe.

